      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Smith_Island%2C_Maryland",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 2018, a jetty‑building project was completed to help protect Smith Island from erosion.",
